  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Satellite Based Water Monitoring and Flow Forecasting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of the implementation of the satellite based Energy and Water Balance Monitoring System (EWBMS) which on a daily basis will provide climatic data fields of temperature  radiation evapotranspiration and precipitation, and the implementation of the Large Scale Hydrological Model (LSHM) which uses the data from the EWBMS to generate river flow rates and forecasts.</narrative>
  </description>
